<title>UK: UK's De La Rue yr profit declines.</title>
<headline>UK's De La Rue yr profit declines.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		35.0		   vs    50.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 16.50		  vs    16.50</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 24.00		  VS    23.75</p>
<p> Pretax		    120.2*		  vs   147.9</p>
<p> Turnover		  768.2		   vs   763.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 124.0 and 129.5 million stg. The company said its ongoing reorganisation will be completed by the end of the current calendar year and would benefit the company by seven million stg per annum.</p>
<p>*The pre-tax profit is also before taking pre-exceptional expenses into account.</p>
<p>Full company name - De La Rue Plc.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
